    "q": "Bag A contains 3 red and 2 black balls. Bag B contains 2 red and 4 black balls. A bag is chosen at random (equal chance) and one ball is drawn from it; the ball drawn is red. What is the probability that it was drawn from Bag A? Give your answer to 4 decimal places.",
